# S24-T05: the proof of a page merge. Run before and after the merge of the probe layers; it must stay green.
# Needs the S24-T05 probe layers on the test site and their page files (knowledge base agent evidence, s24-t05/evidence-pages).
# UsrOrder_FormPage: layer A inserts UsrProbeTrace and a handler that appends "A"; B renames it and appends "B";
# C renames it again, removes UsrWebsite and appends "C". CountryPageV2: onEntityInitialized in three layers appends A, B, C.
use Supervisor
open UsrProbeOrderForm for UsrOrderRulesRecord
check UsrProbeTrace exists
check-value UsrProbeTrace eq "CBA"
check UsrWebsite not exists
check UsrName exists
open UsrProbeCountry for UsrProbeCountryRecord
check-value Description eq "ABC"
end
